{"resourceIdentifier":"4736","resourceName":"CHENGZI RECYCLED AL PROJECT A","description":"Chengzi Recycled Al Project A aims to produce recycled aluminium from aluminium waste products (e.g., window frames, aluminium cans, etc.) sourced from the MSW and to replace primary aluminium produced from raw materials. The Project located in Group 6, Lotus Village, Chengguan Town, Fang County, Shiyan City, Hubei Province, China and is developed and operated by Hubei Chengzi Aluminum Industry Co., Ltd. and Zhonghe Carbon Sink Science and Technology Research (Wuhan) Co., Ltd..\r\nPrior to the project, pure aluminium was extracted from the aluminium ore obtained from the mining of aluminium mines by means of an electrolytic cell, which was the basic scheme of the project. Therefore, the GHG emission reduction will be generated through the implementation of the project by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and reducing related energy consumption as well. The project has started constructed since May 2021, and the date of production line putting into operation is March 2022.\r\nThe project activity will reduce GHG in the atmosphere through an avoiding extraction of raw materials and production of virgin materials. It is estimated that the project will result a total of 410,305 tCO2e emission reductions in the first crediting period of 7 years and with annual average of 58,615 tCO2e emission reduction in the 1st crediting period.","location":{"latitude":32.092776,"longitude":110.705275},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-11-07","endExclusive":"2023-12-08","endInclusive":"2023-12-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4736"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59059"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.AJ."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"23/08/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/03/2022 - 28/02/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=100606&IDKEY=nq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha138735674","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-10-20T01:34:27.227Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=101724&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf140277396","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4736_25OCT2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-07T13:19:27.55Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=117590&IDKEY=dq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha162156610","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_4736_Joint PD-MR_V7.1-Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-08-23T10:37:41.673Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=110224&IDKEY=olksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098a151998896","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"4736-Registration-Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-03-26T02:07:47.847Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/Pr